Bunwrite SDK

The code written for Bunwrite (src/client.ts in part, src/json.ts,
src/browser.ts, src/index.ts, src/services/health.ts, src/services/render.ts
and the build scripts) is under the MIT License below.

Most of src/ is copied from Appwrite's Web SDK (https://github.com/appwrite/sdk-for-web)
and SDK for Node.js (https://github.com/appwrite/sdk-for-node) by
scripts/sdk-sync.ts in the Bunwrite repository, and stays under Appwrite's
BSD 3-Clause License, reproduced after the MIT License. Each copied file says
where it came from at the top.

Bunwrite is an independent project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or sponsored by Appwrite.

